## Model card

- Name: ByteDance Seed 2.0 Pro
- Short description: ByteDance's frontier multimodal reasoning model with 256K context and strong math/visual-reasoning capabilities (per repo `meta.json` short). Part of the Seed family of proprietary models.
- Provider / access: DeepInfra (`deepinfra/ByteDance/Seed-2.0-pro` per repo meta id); also ByteDance API. OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions. No Free ID on Zen (`noFreeId: true`).
- Release: 2026 (Seed 2.0 series). Knowledge cutoff: not published.
- IDs: `deepinfra/ByteDance/Seed-2.0-pro` (repo meta). noFreeId per repo `meta.json`.
- Context window: **256K / 65K out** (per repo `meta.json`).
- Modalities: **Text, image, video in; text out** (per repo `meta.json`). Reasoning yes; tool calls yes; JSON mode yes.
- Pricing (as of 2026-10-01): "Paid-tier pricing" per repo `meta.json`. No concrete numbers in sources verified; positioned as a paid-tier model.
- Architecture: Proprietary dense transformer (ByteDance). No parameter count disclosed.

